msgctxt "80"
msgid "Guh... What's the deal with you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "How about you tell me \"what the deal is\" with this cell phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "That's, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I'm not with the police. As long as you're not using this "
"thing to hurt anybody, I might consider looking the other way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"...Okay. It's a modified cell phone. All calls are free, and since it's "
"under a prepaid contract, none of the data leads back to a single "
"individual."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "And you're selling these illegally or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"That's the idea. We didn't wanna chance getting caught in the act of "
"handing over the goods directly, so we thought about using the locker "
"instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"And thanks to the recent spread of the so-called \"cursed\r\n"
"lockers,\" people have been staying out of our hair. So far\r\n"
"it's worked out great... until you came along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Guess that means our business in Downtown Ryukyu is pretty much boned, "
"thanks to you. Well, let's get outta here, fellas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"(Guess they won't be making any shady deals around here for a while. I'll "
"let it slide, just this once.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Ch-Chrome... It's him! That's the bastard who took our locker key!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Hey. I'd appreciate it if you could give us back that locker key, big "
"fella. That locker's reeeeal important to us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "You mean the one that had this phone inside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"...So you opened it. Well, now that you've seen what's\r\n"
"inside... We can't let you go unharmed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Kill him if you have to... Just get that cell phone back!"
msgstr ""

